PAGE npc7553 branch0 page0 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
Hello there~
Welcome to the
Training Grounds!
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page1 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
Let's see.
Your name is...
Novice.
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page2 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
My name is Shion.
Yes, this is the first time we've met, of course. Hahahaha~!
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page3 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
Now that we've met, is there anything I can help you with?
I'm here for your questions~
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page4 mode5 choices3 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Where should I go?>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <About Basic Interfaces.>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Who the crap are you?>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page5 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
Do you see the bridge to your
right side? Just cross the bridge and you'll arrive at a castle. All you have to do is walk inside!
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page6 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
The entrance of the castle
is a ^4D4DFFspinning white light^000000. These portals are what allow you to move from one zone to another.
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page7 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
Move with the left stick. Use the right stick to rotate and tilt the camera, and the triggers to zoom. Approach a person and press A to talk.
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page8 mode2 choices0 text<[Shion]
So go for it!
Basically, you must enter the castle in order to start your adventures.
>
PAGE npc7553 branch0 page9 mode3 choices0 text<[Shion]
There are soldiers
at the entrance, so don't
worry about getting lost.
Take care now~!
>
