would you like to learn
more about interface
fundamentals?
>
PAGE npc7554 branch1 page3 mode5 choices3 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Yes.>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <Nah, I'm a pro~>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Cancel.>
PAGE npc7554 branch1 page4 mode4 choices0 text<[Kris]
Let me guide you
to the Field Combat
Training Course.
You can come back any time if you feel that you need a review.
>
