PAGE npc7555 branch0 page0 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Novice
Heh, I like your name!
Then, shall we begin the class?
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page1 mode5 choices3 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <What do you teach?>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <I want Field Combat Training now!>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Cancel>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page2 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
I live for power
and die for power!
I shall teach you
my famous fatal blow!
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page3 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
I'm just pulling your chain!
I actually just teach you how to use your skills. I still live for power, though.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page4 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
In Skills, highlight a skill and press X to spend a skill point. Y shows its effects and requirements. Assign an active skill with A, choose a hotbar slot, then confirm with A. Passive skills need no hotbar slot.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page5 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
When your
Skill Window is open,
you'll see an icon labeled
'^3355FFBasic Skill^000000.'
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page6 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Now, at the bottom of the Skill Window, the number of remaining Skill Points that you have is displayed.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page7 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Basic Skill is passive and has nine ranks. Select it in Skills and press X to learn a rank. Press Y for details. Learn rank 9 before changing to your first job.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page8 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
So did you distribute the skill points to your Basic Skills? You'll need to master the Basic Skills eventually, so it's a good idea.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page9 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
For more detailed information on skills, go speak to Leo Handerson, one of the assistant tutors.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page10 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Oh, I almost forgot!
Let me teach you the ^3355FFFirst Aid^000000 skill. This skill will help you out a lot when you're in danger.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page11 mode2 choices0 text<^3355FFYou have learned
the ^4A708BFirst Aid^3355FF skill.^000000
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page12 mode2 choices0 text<^3355FFYou have gained a small
amount of Job experience.^000000
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page13 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Active skills, like First Aid, require a certain amount of SP to use them. The First Aid skill is useful for Novices, since it refills a little bit of HP.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page14 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
You've been
a good student,
so let me reward you!
Behold: bonus experience!
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page15 mode2 choices0 text<[Cecil]
Well, that's it for the essential fundamentals. If you want a more comprehensive lesson, you gotta speak to the assistant tutors.
>
PAGE npc7555 branch0 page16 mode5 choices3 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Okay.>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <Send me to Field Combat Training, now!>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Cancel>
