PAGE npc7556 branch0 page6 mode2 choices0 text<[Alice]
Choose Equips with Select and press A to open and enter it. Highlight a body slot, press A, choose suitable equipment, then press A to equip it. B returns.
>
PAGE npc7556 branch0 page7 mode2 choices0 text<[Alice]
Press Select to choose a window with the D-pad or left stick. Press A to open it, then A to enter its list. B returns. Highlight an open window and move it with the right stick; L3 restores its position. R3 closes the highlighted window.
>
PAGE npc7556 branch0 page8 mode2 choices0 text<[Alice]
Choose Equips with Select and press A to open and enter it. Highlight a body slot, press A, choose suitable equipment, then press A to equip it. B returns.
>
PAGE npc7556 branch0 page9 mode2 choices0 text<[Alice]
Assign an active skill from Skills or a consumable from Items with A, choose a hotbar slot and confirm with A. In play, LEFT/RIGHT selects an action and UP/DOWN changes bars. Press A to use it.
>
PAGE npc7556 branch0 page10 mode2 choices0 text<[Alice]
