the service you'd like to
learn more about.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page5 mode5 choices5 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Save service>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <Storage service>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Teleport service>
 CHOICE 3 ordinal4 <Cart rental service>
 CHOICE 4 ordinal5 <Cancel>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page6 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
The Kafra Corporation is the world's largest company with a long and distinguished history on the Rune-Midgard continent.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page7 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
You can store and retrieve
your items in any town at your convenience. This Storage is shared by every character on one account.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page8 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
It's unreasonable to carry all of your items with you when you don't need them right away. Please use our Storage and keep your items safe and secure.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page9 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Our convenient Storage Service
is provided to our customers for a small fee which is different from town to town.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page10 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
However, you must be
at least ^3355FFBasic Skill Level 6^000000
to use the Storage.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page11 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
There are 3 different item sections of the Storage into which items are organized: Consumable, Equipment and Etc.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page12 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
There are a maximum of 300 Inventory Slots in Kafra Storage, meaning you can have up to 300 different kinds of items in Storage.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch1 page13 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Remember though, that in the case of Equipment, each item takes up one Inventory Slot. The maximum number of items that can be placed in Kafra Storage is 30,000.
>
