PAGE npc7557 branch2 page0 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Welcome to
Kafra Corporation.
The Kafra services are
always on your side.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page1 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
I've been dispatched from Kafra Corporation Headquarters to assist new players such as yourself.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page2 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Please, take heed!
If you move to a town
^4d4dffyou will be unable to return to the Training Grounds ever again^000000.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page3 mode5 choices2 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Teleport Service>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <About Kafra services>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page4 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
I see, you must want to teleport to a town in Rune-Midgard imediately. First, let me briefly inform you about the different towns and cities in Ragnarok.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page5 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Prontera is the capital of the Rune-Midgarts kingdom, and its satellite, Izlude, is closeby.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page6 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
^996633Morroc^000000 is in the desert. It's the town where you can change your job to the Thief and Assassin classes.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page7 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
^006600Payon^000000 is in the mountains, and is famous for its Archer Village, where Novices can change their jobs to Archers.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page8 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
The city of magic, ^993300Geffen^000000, is where people go to become Mages and Wizards.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page9 mode2 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
Please choose
your destination.
>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page10 mode5 choices5 text<>
 CHOICE 0 ordinal1 <Prontera>
 CHOICE 1 ordinal2 <Morroc>
 CHOICE 2 ordinal3 <Payon>
 CHOICE 3 ordinal4 <Alberta>
 CHOICE 4 ordinal5 <Geffen>
PAGE npc7557 branch2 page11 mode4 choices0 text<[Kafra Employee]
You have decided
to go to Payon.
May God be with you.
>
